					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Ok, wanted to let people know what happened to me and to make sure people know that Havek (56 shadow Knight) is not a friend of the guild.<br />
<br />
I was in a group that got wiped in the LK portion of Velks.  This is not an easy CR spot - you have to gate out.  Since I had my druid bound in the bazaar I offered to pickup 3 160pp coffins so Havek could summon the corpses at the zone.<br />
<br />
After getting back to the zone I gave Havek all 3 coffins.  One coffin went to a ranger (meleane) who had her own Necro there.  Havek summoned his corpse then told me he needed to med for mana.  Next thing I know he is in a group headed back to LK and he wont return my tells.<br />
<br />
Not only did he not pay me the 160pp for the coffin, he left me high and dry.<br />
<br />
Cascade Point stepped in and helped me out.  The ranger Meleane is in Cascade Point and had a guild shadow knight (Sarras) come and summon my corpse (I paid her back for the coffin) and also got me a 96% rez in the process.<br />
<br />
Havek is not guilded or I would have gone to his guild.  I also urge anyone who may see him to not give any assistance.  I know I will go out of my way to never group with him again.<br />
<br />
The PP loss does not bother me - leaving me stranded pissed me off.<br />
<br />
Thanks again to Cascade Point.						</td>
